{"seq":32,"slug":"representation-theory","title":"表示论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"表示论\">表示论</h1><p>一个抽象的群，单看乘法表很难把握它的&quot;形状&quot;。表示论给出的策略是：把群里的每个元素翻译成一个具体的矩阵，让抽象的乘法运算变成熟悉的矩阵乘法。一旦群作用在向量空间上，线性代数的全套工具——特征值、不变子空间、内积、对角化——就都能拿来研究群本身。这就是表示论的核心信念：<strong>研究一个对称结构，最好的办法是看它如何线性地作用在空间上</strong>。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿四条主线递进。第一条<strong>基础</strong>回答&quot;为什么&quot;与&quot;是什么&quot;：为何把群搬到矩阵上是值得的，群表示的严格定义，以及何时两个表示本质相同。第二条<strong>结构</strong>进入表示论的骨架：不可约表示是不可再拆的&quot;原子&quot;，Schur 引理刻画原子之间的态射，Maschke 定理保证（在合适条件下）任何表示都能拆成原子的直和。第三条<strong>特征标</strong>给出威力惊人的计算工具：每个表示压缩成一个数值函数——它的特征标——而正交关系让这些函数变成一组正交基，特征标表则把一个有限群的全部不可约表示装进一张小表里。第四条<strong>应用</strong>把视野推向连续群与现实：李群李代数的表示、物理中的对称性（从角动量到夸克模型）、以及调和分析如何把傅里叶变换统一为群上的展开。</p>\n<p>四条主线不是并列堆叠，而是层层依赖：没有&quot;基础&quot;的定义就谈不上&quot;结构&quot;的分解；没有不可约表示与 Schur 引理，&quot;特征标&quot;的正交关系无从证明；而&quot;应用&quot;里的每一个场景——李代数的最高权、物理的多重态、Peter–Weyl 定理——都是前三条主线在更大舞台上的回声。建议初学者严格按 基础 → 结构 → 特征标 → 应用 的顺序阅读；已有抽象代数背景的读者可略读基础，直奔结构与特征标这两章表示论真正独有的内核。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：你需要线性代数（向量空间、线性映射、特征值、内积，见 <a href=\"../linear-algebra/linear-transformations/transformation-basics\">线性变换基础</a>）和群论基础（群、子群、同态，见 <a href=\"../abstract-algebra/groups/group-definition\">群的定义</a>）。复数与基本的复线性代数会反复用到。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：<a href=\"../abstract-algebra/\">抽象代数</a> 讲群、环、域&quot;本身&quot;的内部结构（子群、商、Galois 理论）；本 hub 不重复群论，而是研究群&quot;如何作用在向量空间上&quot;。<a href=\"../linear-algebra/\">线性代数</a> 提供我们使用的全部矩阵工具，但它不涉及&quot;一族矩阵如何编码一个群&quot;。<a href=\"../fourier-analysis/\">傅里叶分析</a> 把傅里叶级数当作分析对象；本 hub 则揭示它为什么是循环群/圆群表示论的特例——分析视角与代数视角在 <a href=\"practice/fourier-harmonic\">调和分析与傅里叶</a> 一篇汇合。<a href=\"../spectral-graph-theory/\">谱图论</a> 用邻接矩阵的谱研究图，与本 hub 共享&quot;用特征值理解对称&quot;的精神，但对象不同。</p>\n<p>表示论近年并非故纸堆：2024 年由 Gaitsgory、Raskin 等九位数学家完成的几何 Langlands 猜想证明（逾 800 页、5 篇论文）把表示论推到现代数学统一图景的中心，Gaitsgory 因此获 2025 年 Breakthrough Prize；与此同时，等变神经网络（equivariant neural networks）让群表示论成为机器学习处理对称性的标准语言。读完这个 hub，你不仅掌握一门经典理论，也握住了通往这些前沿的钥匙。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-representation-theory","title":"为何表示论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/foundations/why-representation-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"group-representations","title":"群表示定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/foundations/group-representations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"equivalence-reducibility","title":"等价与可约性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/foundations/equivalence-reducibility"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"structure","title":"结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"irreducible-representations","title":"不可约表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/structure/irreducible-representations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schur-lemma","title":"Schur 引理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/structure/schur-lemma"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maschke-complete-reducibility","title":"Maschke 与完全可约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/structure/maschke-complete-reducibility"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"characters","title":"特征标","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/characters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"character-theory","title":"特征标理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/characters/character-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"orthogonality-relations","title":"正交关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/characters/orthogonality-relations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"character-tables","title":"特征标表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/characters/character-tables"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lie-groups-algebras","title":"李群与李代数表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/practice/lie-groups-algebras"},{"seq":2,"slug":"representations-in-physics","title":"物理中的表示论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/practice/representations-in-physics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fourier-harmonic","title":"调和分析与傅里叶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/representation-theory/practice/fourier-harmonic"}]}]}